      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a very strange analogy to use for cellular biology. I'm not sure why you're bringing up goblins in a professional discussion about metabolic signaling. Can you please just ignore the metaphors and finish the explanation regarding the caloric surplus and nitrogen balance? You were saying it \"allows...\"",
      "source": "evaluator"
